OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAVisually impaired people fear
OL,4,Asmart glasses backlash
OL,5,
OL,6,FSitting at his desk with some post in
OL,7,Ffront of him, Darren Paskell puts on
OL,8,Fhis glasses and says: "Hey Meta, read
OL,9,Faloud all the text you can see on the
OL,10,Fletter."
OL,12,FWithin seconds a female voice reads the
OL,13,Fwords on the page. For the past 18
OL,14,Fmonths, Darren, who is visually
OL,15,Fimpaired, has used smart glasses for
OL,16,Ftasks including sorting through post
OL,17,Fand reading labels.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,325,320,200,140,0,100
