OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F324A1791375960
OL,1,W5j 5Q5 7575747575x0w1w1 w17571
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAVisually impaired people fear
OL,4,Asmart glasses backlash
OL,5,
OL,6,F"They're really good for identifying
OL,7,Fdifferent jars in the kitchen," said
OL,8,FDarren. "I'm in my 40s now and this is
OL,9,Fthe first time that I've been in a
OL,10,Fposition to wear something, talk to
OL,11,Fsomething and, with a single command,
OL,12,Fget the information that I'm looking
OL,13,Ffor. This technology is absolutely
OL,14,Flife-changing for me."
OL,16,FDarren, who works for the charity Guide
OL,17,FDogs, wears the glasses at home, but
OL,18,Fwould like to use them more in public.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
